        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>FII-809 First Impressions Solid Brass Beaded Oval Pocket Door Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Solid Brass oval shaped sliding pocket door flush pull is of the finest quality, offering both fashion and function. With its beaded style and oval shape, it is a beautiful yet classic piece for your home. For over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing beautiful custom decor for homes, right here is the U.S.A. They offer some of the most diverse and beautiful styles we carry.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\" (.170)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis flush pull is packaged with matching finish mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>*Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/flush-pulls\">Flush Handles</a></b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
